ui-radio-buttons-use-new-color-mappings-and-support-dynamic-color-selected-icons-use-primary = Radio buttons use new color mappings and support dynamic color. Selected icons use primary; unselected icons use on surface variant. Adjacent text retains the on surface color.

ui-color-changes-emphasize-the-selection-without-changing-the-label-these-native-choices-demo = Color changes emphasize the selection without changing the label. These native choices demonstrate the current theme's color roles.

ui-radio-buttons-are-the-recommended-way-to-make-a-single-selection-from-a-visible-list-of-op = Radio buttons are the recommended way to make a single selection from a visible list of options. Only one radio button can be selected at a time. Always accompany each radio with a clear inline label.

ui-use-radio-buttons-to-select-one-option-from-a-set-and-expose-all-available-options-checkbo = Use radio buttons to select one option from a set and expose all available options. Checkboxes are different: several independent options can be selected together.

