ui-use-radio-buttons-when-there-are-five-or-fewer-options-consider-a-drop-down-menu-when-savi = Use radio buttons when there are five or fewer options. Consider a drop-down menu when saving space is important, remembering that opening a menu adds clicks and cognitive effort.

